      "label": "quick_sort() 원문 발췌",
      "code": "void quick_sort(int list[], int left, int right)\n{\n    if (left<right) {\n        int q = partition(list, left, right);\n        quick_sort(list, left, q - 1);\n        quick_sort(list, q + 1, right);\n    }\n}",
